{"id":"n60201-4-7","stage":1,"title":"귀 · 衣角","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60201-4-7-1","ko":"이것 봐. 이 옷의 귀 부분이 다 늘어나 버렸어.","zh":"你看，这件衣服的角边都拉松变形了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이것","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이것：这个","readings":[{"term":"이것","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44878","senseId":"1","lemma":"이것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이것","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"옷의","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷의","audio":"/audio/7096bf1848badef5e3ef.mp3"}},{"text":"귀","meaning":"衣角，衣襟","explanation":"귀：衣角，衣襟","readings":[{"term":"귀","audio":"/audio/001e793a4472c6fe6269.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60201","senseId":"4","lemma":"귀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"귀","audio":"/audio/001e793a4472c6fe6269.mp3"}},{"text":"부분이","meaning":"部分","explanation":"부분：部分；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"부분","audio":"/audio/204cbadbdb5dd2ee0cb9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65853","senseId":"1","lemma":"부분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부분이","audio":"/audio/72ad16ff465faeb690c3.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"늘어나","meaning":"拉长、拉松（衣物变形）","explanation":"늘어나다：原本的长度、体积或程度增加；这里指衣服边角被拉松、变形。后接 -아/어 버리다 表示已经出现了不愿看到的结果。","readings":[{"term":"늘어나다","audio":"/audio/ba47d0c0fad388914dca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62833","senseId":"1","lemma":"늘어나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늘어나","audio":"/audio/cf6b2492f7e1e469b1e1.mp3"}},{"text":"버렸어.","meaning":"做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）","explanation":"버리다：做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"버리다","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62601","senseId":"1","lemma":"버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버렸어","audio":"/audio/fe1d7a5ead4341d8e790.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e414d84c28c86213","term":"이것","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3","entryId":"44878","definition":"指代与说话人较近或说话人所想的东西。","pronunciation":["이걷"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"001e793a4472c6fe","term":"귀","zh":"衣角，衣襟","audio":"/audio/001e793a4472c6fe6269.mp3","entryId":"60201","definition":"上衣衣领的末端。","pronunciation":["귀"]},{"id":"204cbadbdb5dd2ee","term":"부분","zh":"部分","audio":"/audio/204cbadbdb5dd2ee0cb9.mp3","entryId":"65853","definition":"构成整体的小范围；或指把整体分为多个时的其中一个。","pronunciation":["부분"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"ba47d0c0fad38891","term":"늘어나다","zh":"变长、变大；本句指衣物拉松变形","audio":"/audio/ba47d0c0fad388914dca.mp3","entryId":"62833","definition":"变长、变大；本句指衣物拉松变形","pronunciation":["느러나다"]},{"id":"51654377be6bf0a0","term":"버리다","zh":"做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3","entryId":"62601","definition":"做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）","pronunciation":["버리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4a55b24fd5f425b65ab3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60201-4-7-2","ko":"저런, 그거 이제 못 입겠다.","zh":"哎呀，那不能再穿了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저런,","meaning":"啊，哎呀","explanation":"저런：啊，哎呀","readings":[{"term":"저런","audio":"/audio/2f66dcda6095507e43b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71224","senseId":"1","lemma":"저런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저런","audio":"/audio/2f66dcda6095507e43b6.mp3"}},{"text":"그거","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그거：那个","readings":[{"term":"그거","audio":"/audio/4e2a8844f69b923decca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62251","senseId":"2","lemma":"그거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그거","audio":"/audio/4e2a8844f69b923decca.mp3"}},{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"1","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"입겠다.","meaning":"穿","explanation":"입다：穿；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"입다","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17174","senseId":"1","lemma":"입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"입겠다","audio":"/audio/ad3f48c4361688cf06ad.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2f66dcda6095507e","term":"저런","zh":"啊，哎呀","audio":"/audio/2f66dcda6095507e43b6.mp3","entryId":"71224","definition":"听到没料到的、惊奇或可惜的事情时说的词语。","pronunciation":["저런"]},{"id":"4e2a8844f69b923d","term":"그거","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/4e2a8844f69b923decca.mp3","entryId":"62251","definition":"指代前面已提到过的对象。","pronunciation":["그거"]},{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"说话的同时。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"5e126f454a274733","term":"입다","zh":"穿","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3","entryId":"17174","definition":"将衣服披或裹在身上。","pronunciation":["입따"]}],"audio":"/audio/0e3bca9f828075a23150.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.319,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60201","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"4","sourceLevel":"초급","day":41,"sequenceScore":1.7991,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["哎呀，那不能再穿了。","你看，这件衣服的角边都拉松变形了。","您父亲的身体健康状况怎么样？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你看，这件衣服的角边都拉松变形了。","您父亲的身体健康状况怎么样？","哎呀，那不能再穿了。"],"answer":2}]}
